rmal\\\"><span style=\\\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 12pt;\\\"><br>\\n<br>\\n</span><span style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\"></span></p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"background-image: initial;background-position: initial;background-size: initial;line-height: normal;margin-bottom: 0in;vertical-align: baseline;\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 12pt;\\\" class=\\\"\\\">My name is <span class=\\\"dynamic_tag tagId_1659017704367\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-tag=\\\"user_first_name\\\" data-locale=\\\"en_US\\\">&lt;<span style=\\\"color: rgb(73, 135, 169);\\\"><b>user_first_name</b></span>&gt;</span></span><span style=\\\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 12pt;\\\" class=\\\"\\\">&nbsp;with <span class=\\\"dynamic_tag tagId_1683742774544\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-tag=\\\"dealership_name\\\" data-locale=\\\"en_US\\\">&lt;<span style=\\\"color: rgb(73, 135, 169);\\\"><b>dealership_name</b></span>&gt;</span>&nbsp;and I was reaching out regarding your inquiry for more information on the&nbsp;<span class=\\\"dynamic_tag tagId_1659018237730\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-tag=\\\"vehicle_of_interest_make\\\" data-locale=\\\"en_US\\\">&lt;<span style=\\\"color: rgb(73, 135, 169);\\\"><b>vehicle_of_interest_make</b></span>&gt;</span>&nbsp;<span class=\\\"dynamic_tag tagId_1659018246869\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-tag=\\\"vehicle_of_interest_model\\\" data-locale=\\\"en_US\\\">&lt;<span style=\\\"color: rgb(73, 135, 169);\\\"><b>vehicle_of_interest_model</b></span>&gt;</span>.</span></p><p style=\\\"background-image: initial;background-position: initial;background-size: initial;line-height: normal;margin-bottom: 0in;vertical-align: baseline;\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 12pt;\\\" class=\\\"\\\"><br></span></p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"background-image: initial;background-position: initial;background-size: initial;line-height: normal;margin-bottom: 0in;vertical-align: baseline;\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 12pt;\\\">Was there a time that worked best for a phone call?</span><span style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\\\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 12pt;\\\" class=\\\"\\\">Or at your convenience, call <span class=\\\"dynamic_tag tagId_1683742786878\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-tag=\\\"dealership_phone\\\" data-locale=\\\"en_US\\\">&lt;<span style=\\\"color: rgb(73, 135, 169);\\\"><b>dealership_phone</b></span>&gt;</span>&nbsp;to speak to sales.</span></p><p style=\\\"background-image: initial;background-position: initial;background-size: initial;line-height: normal;margin-bottom: 0in;vertical-align: baseline;\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 12pt;\\\"><br></span></p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"background-image: initial;background-position: initial;background-size: initial;line-height: normal;margin-bottom: 0in;vertical-align: baseline;\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 12pt;\\\">We are available <b>Monday-Saturday 9AM-9PM</b> | <b>Sunday\\n11AM-6PM.</b></span></p><p style=\\\"background-image: initial;background-position: initial;background-size: initial;line-height: normal;margin-bottom: 0in;vertical-align: baseline;\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 12pt;\\\"><b class=\\\"\\\"><br></b></span></p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"background-image: initial;background-position: initial;background-size: initial;line-height: normal;margin-bottom: 0in;vertical-align: baseline;\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 12pt;\\\" class=\\\"\\\">I appreciate the opportunity to assist in your new vehicle\\nsearch, and we are here at your pace to explore options when you are ready! Let\\nus know a good time that works for you and look forward to speaking with you.&nbsp;</span><span style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\"></span></p><p style=\\\"background-image: initial;background-position: initial;background-size: initial;line-height: normal;margin-bottom: 0in;vertical-align: baseline;\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><br></p><p style=\\\"background-image: initial;background-position: initial;background-size: initial;line-height: normal;margin-bottom: 0in;\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><b><span style=\\\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 9pt;\\\"><br>\\n</span></b><span style=\\\"font-size: 10.5pt;\\\"></span></p><p style=\\\"background-image: initial;background-position: initial;background-size: initial;line-height: normal;margin: 2.25pt 0in 3.75pt;margin-bottom: 3.75pt;margin-left: 0in;margin-right: 0in;margin-top: 2.25pt;\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 10pt;\\\" class=\\\"\\\">Have A Great Day,</span></p>\"},\"configuration\":{\"selectable\":false,\"editable\":true,\"draggable\":false,\"freezed\":false,\"focusable\":true,\"deletable\":true},\"compId\":\"6da7c514-d2d6-47ac-8854-85d822f7e15a\"},{\"key\":\"INSERT_SIGNATURE\",\"componentProps\":{\"compAlignment\":\"center\",\"isUserSignature\":false},\"configuration\":{\"selectable\":true,\"editable\":true,\"draggable\":false,\"freezed\":true,\"focusable\":true,\"deletable\":true,\"footerProps\":{\"order\":1}},\"compId\":\"5d861fe0-5a59-46b7-97ea-d0aa21c05e46\"},{\"key\":\"INSERT_FOOTER_TEMPLATE\",\"componentProps\":{\"id\":\"61480bfa0c7692000660de4c\",\"html\":\"\\n  <table data-type=\\\"TEXT_TEMPLATE\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\">\\n    <tbody>\\n      <tr>\\n        <td style=\\\"padding: 6px 0px;padding-bottom: 6px;padding-left: 0px;padding-right: 0px;padding-top: 6px;\\\" class=\\\"\\\">\\n          <div style=\\\"height: auto;width: 100%;\\\"><div contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" style=\\\"cursor: text;height: 100%;\\\" id=\\\"46d0e7cf-5d20-4209-a3a2-b0156ac353bc\\\" class=\\\"\\\"><div>We do not rent, sell or exchange email addresses. 